{
  "label": "christmas5",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label christmas5:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": LADIES AND GENTLEMEN...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": WELL, ALL LADIES. SEEING AS THE ONLY GENTLEMAN IN THE ROOM HAS WALKED IN ALONGSIDE ME, MOLLY MACCORMACK.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this really necessary?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How would you all like a chance...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To make your dreams come true?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle1.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is going on right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Friends. Companions. Stray adventurers looking to stable your pets-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hold in my hand the key to everything you have ever wanted.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I speak not of an elixir that will turn you into the Molly MacCormack you all saw on Halloween.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, this bottle holds nothing at all.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle2.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": NOTHING BUT DREAMS.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "God I hate Christmas.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle3.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, Molly seems passionate. Even by her standards.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...bottles can’t actually hold dreams, can they?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know what she’s talking about.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Me neither. But I guess we can just wait to see how this plays out.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle4.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh no.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He let Molly choose.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let her choose what? The present he forgot about?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, it’s better to get her opinion than just letting him get something on his own, isn’t it?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least she’s a girl.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s better than 700 Yen worth of pocket change.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, we’ll see about that.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle5.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, I suppose you’re likely wondering how a bottle can hold dreams.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, she read your mind! It’s one of her powers!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shh! I’m listening!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Under most circumstances, thoughts like that would make sense. I mean, it’s just a bottle. How can it hold anything other than milk or Guinness?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bottles hold more than-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Silence, Sir. You have entrusted the present you forgot about to me, so I must take it in my own hands to make the dreams of one lucky girl (Preferably me) come true!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And she flat out just told everyone he forgot...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really, Molly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle6.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Friends, take a look around you.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re all gathered here, listening to Western Christmas music, eating food from a Western food chain, celebrating a Westernized holiday...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wouldn’t you say it would be beneficial to all of us if we were to break out another classic Western game in...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Spin the bottle?...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle7.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So that’s your game, Molly MacCormack.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Failure is not an option, Chika.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You will spin the bottle. And you will win.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know you’re looking at me, Futaba.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You heard nothing.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...good luck?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t need luck. Victory will be mine.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle8.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...Ayane?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What happens when you spin the bottle?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s a game Western [teens] used to play in like, the 80’s.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Someone goes up and spins the bottle and they need to kiss whoever the bottle points at when it’s done spinning.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle9.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They have to...what?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just as worried as you. Well, probably more worried.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If anyone spins the bottle, they have almost a 10%% chance of having it land on Sensei.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I see anyone but me kiss him, I will literally explode.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hate the thought of it so much that I even broke out percentages.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you know I’m actually smart, Sana? I bet you didn’t know that.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": K...Kiss?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...I don’t...want to kiss...anyone here...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that’s reassuring for me at least. Thank you for being such a good girl.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want to go home...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle10.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! What is the meaning of this?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you forcing such a lecherous game on us instead of actually getting a real present?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know what you’re thinking, but it really wasn’t me this time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So you didn’t forget to buy a present for someone?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, that part was me. But the bottle thing was all Molly.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Likely story.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you going to do if someone spins it and it lands on you?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well I mean, I have to abide by the rules at that point, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle11.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Excuse me?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re really gonna just lock lips with somebody smack-dab in the middle of our Christmas party?",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As if I’d ever let that happen...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, even I don’t like the sound of that and I normally just let stuff like this happen.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How often have you been faced with scenarios like this, Miku?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heck if I know. Just don’t friggin’ kiss anybody in the middle of our party.",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle12.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can one bottle truly possess so much power?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Leave it to the Emerald Guardian of the Crystal Forest to make all of our dreams come true.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": K...K...Kiss...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hehehe~ Looks like this party has a chance to get interesting after all. Way to go, Irish girl.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ki...Ki...Kirin...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is...past our b-b-b-bed time...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We need to be heading...home...before...one of us gets...p...p...pregnant.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No way, sis. We can’t leave now. We finally got to the good part.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If the bottle lands on me, I can finally go to Virginia.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle13.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle14.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Molly walks up to the table, bottle in hand, and prepares to make the first spin.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I accompany her, crouching down to get a better look at the spin because, let’s face it, I’m excited too.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There’s literally no way I can lose this game.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I should probably be sure she’s okay with putting what I assume is her first kiss entirely in the hands of fate.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure you want to do this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course, Sir.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have bestowed upon me the chance to make my dreams come true. To finally become the lead heroine! And in front of everyone else at that!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I accept my fate regardless of the outcome, for if there are higher powers out there, they shall truly force the two of us together!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You two? Really? Yeah, not happening.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good luck, Irish girl!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you spin it really softly, it’s sure to land on Sensei!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": D...DON’T...SPIN!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": BOTTLES ARE...BAD!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good luck, Emerald Guardian. If we have to kiss, please be gentle.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene spinthebottle15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/spinthebottle15.webp",
      "alt": "spinthebottle15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly MacCormack requires no luck. She has been putting all of her points into that since the beginning of time.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I carry with me the heart of my homeland! The luck of the Irish!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And so I put this in the hands of the fae! Gift unto me a dream come true!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bottlespin1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/bottlespin1.webp",
      "alt": "bottlespin1"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene bottlespin2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
